# Authorization code flow, step 1: open this url in player browser.
# Player is redirected to /oauth/interaction/xxx to authorize the application,
# then back to redirect_uri with ?code=xxx
# Then exchange the code within 60 seconds, see token.http.

@clientId=my-client-id
@redirectUri=http://localhost:9999/callback
@scope=openid%20read:profile

### Confidential client (with secret), no PKCE: exchange code without code_verifier

GET /oidc/auth?client_id={{ clientId }}&response_type=code&redirect_uri={{ redirectUri }}&scope={{ scope }}&prompt=consent&state=random-state

### Public client (no secret), must send code_challenge (PKCE, S256): exchange code with code_verifier

GET /oidc/auth?client_id={{ clientId }}&response_type=code&redirect_uri={{ redirectUri }}&scope={{ scope }}&prompt=consent&state=random-state&code_challenge=E9Melhoa2OwvFrEMTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM&code_challenge_method=S256
